          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Bioschemas classes and properties for laboratory workflow provenance in CDIF. Defines types and properties from the Bioschemas vocabulary and the ARC Workflow Run RO-Crate profile for describing lab processes, protocols, samples, parameters, equipment, and computational tools.
:title: "CDIF Bioschemas Properties"
:prefix: ``bios``</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties.BioschemasProperties"/>
        </ownedComment>
