          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

A Bioschemas FormalParameter describing the shape and type of inputs and outputs of a workflow protocol. Values are realized in process executions through bios:parameterValue PropertyValue objects. In cdifProvActivity output, mapped to schema:MediaObject with additionalType bios:FormalParameter.
:prefix: ``schema``
:typeSchema: {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}, "description": "Should include schema:MediaObject with additionalType bios:FormalParameter"}
:typeOptional:</body>
